text/html,,retained prior type,0,"August 2025Best Golf Shops Private W hen I became the PGA Head Professional at Whispering Pines in 2004, my budget was to make $80,000 for the golf shop with 6,000 rounds. In 2024, Whispering Pines recorded 15,000 rounds and the golf shop grossed $1.5 million. Here is how my team and I made this happen: What Am I Wearing?: Numerous times during the two seasons our club is open I’ll call the shop from the golf course and whoever answers the phone has to tell me exactly what I wore to work that day. This has become a fun game with my staff, but the main reason I do this to them is to make them a","{""bounded_link_count"": 11, ""bounded_visible_character_count"": 4185, ""html_title"": ""August 2025Best Golf Shops Private""}",11707,https://read.nxtbook.com/ggrw/mplus/august_2025/best_golf_shops_private.html,EXTLOC-e772296788b769a6eb6d735c,,police,html,200,payroll_roster,https://read.nxtbook.com/ggrw/mplus/august_2025/best_golf_shops_private.html,low,0,0,False,EXTCAND-ec2721210c056f5add13dc08,,MECHEXP-20051c97f27fd99aa1c9fe96|MECHEXP-679be677624b6129d6c0671b|MECHEXP-708e8376e5eb2cdaa8408c49|MECHEXP-78138d3913cf6ae6555c5da6|MECHEXP-7a80a6209c85ba0b2cbbd32e,ROOTCOMP-6b75620484d676b1f4ff01d4,external_search_wave_001_compacted,,read.nxtbook.com,Whispering Pines,0,false,best_golf_shops_private.html,2024,multi_family_administrative_source,payroll_roster,manual_review_candidate,1,,2026-08-05T17:26:01.913815+00:00,0,benefits_and_total_compensation|implementation_confirmation|payroll_and_earnings|staffing_and_headcount,police,reputable_secondary_context,EXTSRCREV-f43984eb6f019fe686cfa576,source_review_lane_003,5735,secondary context deferred from administrative readiness,secondary_context_only_deferred,NC
