text/html; charset=utf-8,,retained prior type,0,"The Ranger - March 6 The Ranger - March 6 The Ranger March 6, 2024 Renovation of Eveleth apartments underway, will increase housing stock Countryside Apartments in West Eveleth is remodeling 42 units located in two buildings. Iron Range Resources & Rehabilitation supported the project with a $78,000 Commercial Redevelopment grant to the city of Eveleth that helped pay for internal demolition including the removal of the old flooring, kitchens, bathrooms, trims, doors, shelving and appliances. The internal demolition paved the way for the owner to fully renovate the apartments’ interior. Total ","{""bounded_link_count"": 24, ""bounded_visible_character_count"": 11023, ""html_title"": ""The Ranger - March 6""}",44449,https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/MNIRRRB/bulletins/38cb466,EXTLOC-0be32cf22a563f9026dbd11e,,unclear,html,200,payroll_roster,https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/MNIRRRB/bulletins/38cb466,low,0,0,False,RESCAND-ca417879876579bd25b677a6,,MECHEXP-02cf3739210362455d2594ae|MECHEXP-21ae47769e764b9c9b6e35b5|MECHEXP-31143a3a189cf37d98f93926|MECHEXP-a7027bee60ff3aa9fdd249fe,ROOTCOMP-96ed16f4cc8ca12f1821e18b,external_search_wave_002_exhaustive_residual,,content.govdelivery.com,Biwabik,0,false,38cb466,2019,multi_family_administrative_source,payroll_roster,manual_review_candidate,1,,2026-08-05T17:29:54.718696+00:00,0,implementation_confirmation|payroll_and_earnings|tenure_and_progression,unclear,reputable_secondary_context,EXTSRCREV-db8632abc89ec45c63d25b29,source_review_lane_003,7392,secondary context deferred from administrative readiness,secondary_context_only_deferred,MN
